 "title": "Gcn2 and GCN1 Protein Interactions and Regulation",
 "summary": "This cluster revolves around the Gcn2 protein and its interactions with other proteins and processes. Gcn2 activates the GCN4 gene and the Gcn1-Gcn2 interaction process. It also binds to and phosphorylates several proteins, including eIF2 alpha kinase and eIF2α. The GCN1 protein has a region that is deleted in ESY10069 and requires Gcn2-HsC for its function. The cluster also includes various methods and tools used to study Gcn2 and GCN1, such as Gcn2-HsC, ScGcn2, and HsRWDBD+CTD.",
